      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey im kinda worried. about an hour ago my vision like went totally blurry in just my left eye for maybe like 2 mins? and my right hand felt really clumsy and weird like i couldnt grip stuff well but now im feeling totally fine. is this something serious or should i just keep an eye on it?",
