      "content": "i mean i get that but i have a lot of stress and headaches all the time, and i always get these weird aura things before a migraine. it pretty much fits that pattern perfectly. i just feel like if i go to the er now, they're just gonna run some basic tests, tell me i'm fine to go home, and charge me like a thousand bucks for basically nothing. isn't it better to just wait a day or two and see if it happens again before i go in? if i'm not actually having symptoms right now, isn't it kind of an overreaction?",
